# Story: a writer has a browser and notes on either side of the Desktop and is reading the browser
# on its own. One slip (Arrange instead of Desktop) rearranges everything; one undo puts it all back,
# the view included. Then a window dropped on the wrong edge, and a window that closed in between.
# Written by the executor swarm. Spec: F19. Window ids start at 101.
# The three tiling switches of the guide's section 2 are off: with macOS's own tiling on, the left, right and top edges of the screen are macOS's (Q23).
mac-tiling off
open Safari
open Notes
open Mail
undo
expect fail
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
zoom 101
expect fills 101
# The slip.
arrange
expect count docked 3
expect camera root
undo
expect ok
expect count docked 2
expect floating 103
expect camera 101
expect fills 101
expect hidden 102
# Changing one's mind again.
redo
expect count docked 3
undo
expect fills 101
# Moving the view is not a step: undo goes past it, and leaves the view alone.
show-all
expect visible 102
undo
expect floating 102
expect docked 101
expect camera root
redo
expect left-of 101 102
# A drop on the wrong edge.
drag 103 1437 450
expect docked 103
expect left-of 102 103
undo
expect floating 103
expect visible 103
# A docked window that closed cannot come back. Undo says so once, then goes on to what it can
# still take back, passing over the step that was about the closed window.
dock 103 beside 101 bottom
close 103
undo
expect fail
expect docked 102
undo
expect ok
expect floating 102
expect docked 101
# A new change clears redo.
float 101
redo
expect fail
undo
expect docked 101
undo
expect floating 101
undo
expect fail
# With one window framed, a change elsewhere would not show, and the next press would take back something
# else. The view steps out just far enough to show it; Back returns.
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
resize 102 left 80
zoom 101
expect hidden 102
undo
expect ok
expect visible 102
back
expect fills 101
# A dozen taps on a shortcut that each move an edge a little are one adjustment, and one undo.
show-all
resize 101 right 20
resize 101 right 20
resize 101 right 20
undo
expect ok
undo
expect ok
expect floating 102
expect docked 101
